  "retention_detail": "Four discrete integral corner bosses are the panel's only bearing surfaces. Each boss has a 9 mm root into its adjacent front/rear fixed roof edge; the rear roots fill the rear-wall thickness. The \u2212X pair connect into the sidewall. The +X pair also have full-depth 9 mm roots into the +X fixed roof, supporting each boss on two sides. Four recessed M3x12 screws engage RX-M3x5.7 heatsets. No perimeter rim."
